==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*6 [[Znache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Znache]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Znache]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

